    "modification": "WOOW HA add-on: (1) http(): do not pass follow_redirects, trust_env, transport or verify to backend_policy.async_client, which sets the first two itself (v0.1.0 raised TypeError on every call) and owns the transport (TLS always verified). (2) send(): any failure, not only httpx's, goes through errors.backend_error(); redirect and unexpected-status texts are fixed (no Location target, the error body and its Sabre message are never read); a failed response close is logged by type and does not replace the answer or the original error. (3) _fetch_user_id(): its own messages start with BACKEND_HTTP_ERROR status=N / BACKEND_INVALID_RESPONSE. (4) probe(): the gateway HealthMonitor's private readiness probe: one OCS GET cloud/user on a fresh client (never the tools' connections or the cached user id), closed afterwards, answering only {ok, user_id}."
  },
